^dEngine

^fGeneral

* Fixed ^8cl_shownet^9 may print invalid entity number (Thanks to Quake3e)

^dClient

* Fixed OpenAL backend sound drop sound when out of range
* Fixed OpenAL backend sound looped sound restarting after re-entering PVS

^dServer

* Fixed tv demo fast forwarding command not working on client

^dMod

^fGeneral

* Fixed camera commands not being available in demo playback
* Added ^8sharetimerNL^9 and ^8sharetimer_buddyNL^9 command to share timer without
  location string

^fGraphic

* Fixed overheat smoke doesn't appear in third person
* Fixed overheated weapons has smoke when leaving overheated mounted MG
* Fixed overheated weapons shakes when leaving a mounted MG you have started shooting
  with

^fUI

* Fixed ^8popupmessage4^9 comp wasn't displaying obituaries messages
* Added following filter to ^8popupmessage^9 component style :
  * ^8No Announce^9   : Filter out all map script messages (command post constructed,
    tank damaged, etc.)
  * ^8No Enemy Team^9 : Filter out all obituaries caused by the enemy team
  * ^8No Own Team^9   : Filter out all obituaries caused by your own team
  * ^8No Self^9       : Filter out all obituaries due/caused by yourself
  * ^8No Suicide^9    : Filter out all obituaries for self kills (of all players)
* Reordered HUD timers for a more consistent display

* Limbo
  * Added in-game Skills And Rewards tooltips. Hover over skill counter with mouse
    will display the tooltip
